{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The fast exit came from Vibe trying to read a missing Mistral API key through the macOS Keychain. The sandbox correctly blocked `/usr/bin/security`, so Vibe exited before sending the prompt.\n\nI updated [run-vibe.sh](/tmp/h-dnE7zC/run-vibe.sh) and [config.toml](/tmp/h-dnE7zC/vibe/config.toml) to keep startup on the configured OpenRouter model and prevent the Keychain lookup. The cause and fix are recorded in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-dnE7zC/ANSWER.md).\n\nAn offline probe passed session setup and ran until its five-second deadline. A live OpenRouter run was not performed."}}
